  "body": "Hello lovely humans,\n\n[sass-lint](https://www.npmjs.com/package/sass-lint) just published its new version 1.9.0.\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      State\n    </th>\n    <td>\n      Failing tests :warning:\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      Dependency\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      sass-lint\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      New version\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      1.9.0\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      Type\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      devDependency\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n\nThis version is **covered** by your **current version range** and after updating it in your project **the build kept failing**.\n\n**It looks like your project, in its current form, is malfunctioning** and this update didn’t really change that. I don’t want to leave you in the dark about updates though. I recommend you get your project passing and then check the impact of this update again.\n\nDo you have any ideas how I could improve these pull requests? Did I report anything you think isn’t right?\nAre you unsure about how things are supposed to work?\n\nThere is a collection of [frequently asked questions](https://greenkeeper.io/faq.html) and while I’m just a bot, there is a group of people who are happy to teach me new things. [Let them know](https://github.com/greenkeeperio/greenkeeper/issues/new).\n\nGood luck with your project :sparkles:\n\nYou rock!\n\n:palm_tree:\n\n---\n\n[GitHub Release](https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/releases/tag/v1.9.0)\n\n<h2>v1.9.0</h2>\n\n\n<p><strong>August 18, 2016</strong></p>\n\n\n<p><strong>Fixes</strong></p>\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed an issue with the indentation rule when it encountered at-rules with no block immediately preceding a map <a href=\"https://urls.greenkeeper.io/sasstools/sass-lint/issues/779\">#779</a> <a href=\"https://urls.greenkeeper.io/sasstools/sass-lint/issues/783\">#783</a>\n</li>\n<li>Fixed an issue in <code>single-lint-per-selector</code> where inline comments were seen as selectors <a href=\"https://urls.greenkeeper.io/sasstools/sass-lint/issues/789\">#789</a>\n</li>\n<li>Fixed an issue with interpolation in placeholders within the <code>bem-depth</code> rule <a href=\"https://urls.greenkeeper.io/sasstools/sass-lint/issues/782\">#782</a>\n</li>\n<li>Removed duplicated code from <code>no-mergeable-selectors</code> to helper methods</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p><strong>Documentation</strong></p>\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed typos in no-vendor-prefixes rule documentation <a href=\"https://urls.greenkeeper.io/sasstools/sass-lint/issues/787\">#787</a>\n</li>\n<li>Added link to Visual Studio extension <a href=\"https://urls.greenkeeper.io/sasstools/sass-lint/pull/815\">#815</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p><strong>New Rules</strong></p>\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Added the <code>no-color-hex</code> rule to disallow all hexadecimal colour definitions <a href=\"https://urls.greenkeeper.io/sasstools/sass-lint/issues/754\">#754</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p><strong>Updates</strong></p>\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Gonzales-pe updated to version 3.4.4 which fixes a lot of longstanding issues see the <a href=\"https://urls.greenkeeper.io/tonyganch/gonzales-pe/blob/dev/CHANGELOG.md\">Changelog</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n---\n\nThe new version differs by 50 commits .\n- [`38d43ad`](https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/38d43ad0a942b5c70a4360f128d464aceb636e43) <code>Merge pull request #829 from sasstools/release/1.9.0</code>\n- [`9db9bea`](https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/9db9beaedcfb6fae4e4051b2fe6e4f391c32ef56) <code>Prepare 1.9.0</code>\n- [`052dcd1`](https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/052dcd111b8da46c109d59d2338626e2a64cd473) <code>Merge pull request #823 from DanPurdy/feature/tidy-mergeable-selectors</code>\n- [`dc2d59d`](https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/dc2d59df7443f5e85017cf31176c2c98842ecb43) <code>Merge branch 'develop' into feature/tidy-mergeable-selectors</code>\n- [`91dfe0b`](https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/91dfe0b127ac99b14e6c827690a458ae7abf115f) <code>Merge pull request #754 from DanPurdy/feature/no-color-hex</code>\n- [`831caa2`](https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/831caa269294526c45eb83fd9d36b32751b8c2b7) <code>Merge branch 'develop' into feature/no-color-hex</code>\n- [`2f0407a`](https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/2f0407a087f6b52fcc1ce620f975308a1abfa113) <code>Merge pull request #818 from DanPurdy/feature/update-bem-depth</code>\n- [`a0e8496`](https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/a0e8496b78aba33b1ccdeb6f76947769a9bcf1f8) <code>Merge branch 'develop' into feature/update-bem-depth</code>\n- [`7542078`](https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/75420782b116ccd59f1c31c0041a0c3172b64342) <code>Merge branch 'develop' into feature/no-color-hex</code>\n- [`9f56a17`](https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/9f56a1739b6e262c6bf23b5aa4ae090521b32a2d) <code>Merge pull request #817 from DanPurdy/feature/fix-single-line-per-selector</code>\n- [`6484be6`](https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/6484be633bda5597c0ea55391fd4b7e8fd64faef) <code>Merge branch 'develop' into feature/fix-single-line-per-selector</code>\n- [`fcc92a7`](https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/fcc92a7b2360d4c86c8c0db4755123f71060aac8) <code>Merge branch 'develop' into feature/no-color-hex</code>\n- [`e43b349`](https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/e43b349ab65abc7bd70e9bee417bc3748a52c931) <code>:art: Remove duplicate functions</code>\n- [`654bf72`](https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/654bf72e573c85f7a8638e1980066fbefbd6764b) <code>:white_check_mark: Add constructSelector tests</code>\n- [`22c7c32`](https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/22c7c321b259f5ddfef0810ac7c3a23892d7cf49) <code>:bug: Fix interpolation in placeholders - bem depth</code>\n\nThere are 50 commits in total. See the [full diff](https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/compare/9ee2b856ed479915f0f6d881af891eb4f5e207ce...38d43ad0a942b5c70a4360f128d464aceb636e43).\n\n---\n\nThis pull request was created by [greenkeeper.io](https://greenkeeper.io/).\n\n<sub>Tired of seeing this sponsor message? :zap: `greenkeeper upgrade`</sub>\n",
